    "goal": "Co-seed HUVEC-T1 and PHH in a 6-well plate at 9.4e4 cells/cm² total across 2.22 cm² per well, with 0.17 of the total assigned to HUVEC-T1.",
    "rationale": "Co-culture of HUVEC-T1 (population A, vascular) and primary human hepatocytes PHH (population B, liver) in a 6-well plate. Total seeding density 9.4e4 cells/cm² over 2.22 cm²/well gives 208,680 cells/well. Fraction A = 0.17 (HUVEC-T1), fraction B = 0.83 (PHH). PHH are primary cells that do not divide in vitro, so the B population is fixed at seeding; HUVEC-T1 will proliferate, so the 0.17 fraction is the seeding stoichiometry, not steady-state. PHH are BSL-2.",
